{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436330/extras/90abb83f488a40965f19ff1b0c6a59a8.avif?t=1760673032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436330/extras_big/90abb83f488a40965f19ff1b0c6a59a8.avif?t=1760673032 width=800 height=450 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Story</h2><br>I finally got my hands on a girl in a box.<br>She hasn't had any training yet, so I'm afraid she'll try to run away as soon as she comes out.<br>But it doesn't matter, I'm well prepared.<br>I'm going to train her to my liking.......<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436330/extras/bc74f9889ebcf0b46ff6b9244b7e8482.avif?t=1760673032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436330/extras_big/bc74f9889ebcf0b46ff6b9244b7e8482.avif?t=1760673032 width=800 height=450 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Gameplay</h2><br>This is a game to raise a girl in a box, please make the girl into the shape of your heart!<br>There are two periods in a day, morning and evening, and you can perform one action in each period.<br>Satiety, Obedience, and Endurance are capped at 10 and will trigger a Gameover if they reach 0.<br>There are four types of actions, each with three different events, each of which will increase/decrease the values of the above three and consume an action.<br>Each action accumulates four values.<br>The options in the action events don't affect the value of the action, and the options are color-coded to avoid selecting unwanted content.<br>When the value exceeds 15, you can choose to unlock the ending of the action, there are a total of four endings.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436330/extras/d513e6890a2dc298c81353cfc1266c73.avif?t=1760673032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436330/extras_big/d513e6890a2dc298c81353cfc1266c73.avif?t=1760673032 width=800 height=450 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Game Features</h2><br>\u25c7 24 base CGs, with over 480 variations<br>\u25c7 One main female character<br>\u25c7 A training simulation (raising) themed game<br>\u25c7 Multiple endings: 4 different outcomes<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436330/extras/0eafcec6870e3b766ade7c196da1f471.avif?t=1760673032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436330/extras_big/0eafcec6870e3b766ade7c196da1f471.avif?t=1760673032 width=800 height=450 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3436330?t=1760673032","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3436330?t=1760673032","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436330/5a22f453f0e948cce25a7797276f609fb736a9ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760673032","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436330/5a22f453f0e948cce25a7797276f609fb736a9ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760673032","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,3,4,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work . The game contains Nudity or Sexual Content, Extreme Violence, sexual assault, non-consensual sex, BDSM, General Mature Content.\r\nAll characters are over the age of 20."},"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436330/extras/90abb83f488a40965f19ff1b0c6a59a8.avif?t